      "score": 0.961411714553833,
      "title": "Figure 1. When developing LLMs-powered multi-agent systems, failure attribution—identifying system components responsible for task failures based on evaluation results—has received limited attention in existing research. This process is typically performed manually, demanding substantial labor and specialized expertise. In this study, we explore the potential for automating this process.",
